Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I never thought Yuzuru\Nwould just vanish like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.23,0:00:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At midnight, last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...the instant the date changed,\NYuzuru was erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.82,0:00:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is Natsumi impersonating\Namong the 12 people?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as I can't guess right,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,will people disappear\Nevery night, one by one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That seems to be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll get easier to guess\Nas the days pass, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...that means more people will be erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tsk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.63,0:00:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've gotta find out who she is in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.13,0:00:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not only for everyone,\Nbut for Natsumi, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.35,0:00:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In that case, Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.85,0:00:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it about time you figure out\Nif I'm the real Kotori Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At the least, that's what I want to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.36,0:00:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this any time to be saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.48,0:00:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's plenty of ways you could confirm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:00:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By asking me questions, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.53,0:01:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um, in order to judge my reaction,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.87,0:01:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,k-kiss me, or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.83,0:01:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.17,0:01:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sh-Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.42,0:01:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! What are you doing, Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.09,0:01:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Give it back! Give it back already!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Yup! That's Kotori all right.\N--Big Brother! Give it back! Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--There's no way Natsumi could\Nimitate this side of you...\N--Big Brother! Give it back! Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.52,0:01:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...so well, right, Kotori?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.48,0:01:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um, my dear Kotori?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to rush along\Nyour dates with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:40.45,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Three:\N'You're Natsumi'"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.53,0:01:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know the schedule's\Npretty tight as it is, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to fit as many people in\Nas possible before the day changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.33,0:01:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll leave the arrangements to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood. I'll do the best I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As for now, you can date Miku as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.47,0:01:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.09,0:02:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey, Miku!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.97,0:02:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You never told me we'd be\Ngoing on a date in costumes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'm kinda an idol, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.31,0:02:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It would be a pain if someone found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can cosplay freely in this park today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.65,0:02:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since we're finally on a date, I don't\Nwant anyone to get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.78,0:02:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I suppose that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kanon Tsukishima and\NSeig from {\i1}Valkyrie Misty{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.62,0:02:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In the rare masks from episode\Nsix when they saved Misty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we please take your photo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What? No, we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon! You, too, Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.83,0:02:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There it is! The signature\Npose of our lovely Seig!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.73,0:02:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you call us out for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:03:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're making amends for\Nwhat you did, this isn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.66,0:03:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, this has nothing to do with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.41,0:03:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since we're classmates, I thought\Nit's good to chat once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.87,0:03:12.88,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Guidance Office"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.29,0:03:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What's the matter, Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wanting to talk about\Nthe future all of a sudden...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.01,0:03:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, well. How do I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need to start thinking about\Nmy future more seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That promise you made me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.44,0:03:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't forgot about it either, Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.65,0:03:35.90,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Marriage Registration"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.19,0:03:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.03,0:03:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.28,0:03:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See that, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.82,0:03:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was my special move,\NDunkelheit Windhose!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With my honed special move,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and this legendary item, the\NFegefeuer Gauntlet, in my possession,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,you stand no chance to beat me, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, legendary?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You just bought that over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.01,0:04:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph! More importantly, lest you forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.89,0:04:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We promised the loser of our match\Ndoes whatever the winner desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm well aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.69,0:04:19.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here comes my big comeback!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.98,0:04:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Ah!\N--Shido Itsuka falls apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.49,0:04:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You may sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My first order.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For the next ten minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.62,0:04:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,you won't be surprised, flustered,\Nor try to stop me, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you vow to never speak of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A-All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is much more comfy than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You could even be my\Nfull-time pillow if you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You little...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.40,0:05:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do I hear the loser complaining?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then, shall I have\Nyou pat my head, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.07,0:05:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Kaguya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.63,0:05:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru... Yuzuru...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaguya, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.93,0:05:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You say there was an exam, but really,\Nyou haven't found Yuzuru yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.39,0:05:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I'd know. Don't think I'm stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.19,0:05:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, you thought it was better\NI didn't know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.90,0:05:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, I'll believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because that day, the one who\Ngave me and Yuzuru a third choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...was you, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.41,0:05:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaguya...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.25,0:06:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Save Yuzuru... Save Yuzuru...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Good grief, you're pathetic"...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...is not what I'll be saying today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.51,0:06:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You beat the schedule and\Ndated 11 people in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That'd exhaust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.89,0:06:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'm the one who asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.35,0:06:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So? Did you sense anything\Nwrong when meeting them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think Miku and Kaguya have to be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.78,0:06:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My teacher and the girls\Ndidn't seem off at all either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.78,0:06:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to get it right quickly, but I don't\Nwant anyone to be Natsumi either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even so, it's about that time\Nyou need to give an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.63,0:06:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, even if want to guess who Natsumi is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.55,0:06:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't really know that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This whole game goes along with\Nthe whims and rules of Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:07:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I imagine she's observing us\Nfrom somewhere at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right on the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi there, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Day two of the game is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you having fun yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.79,0:07:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this even about, Natsumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I never asked for this game!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just bring Yuzuru back and\NI'll talk it out with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you're not feeling up to it,\Nit's already set in motion, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, who am I impersonating?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm ready to hear your answer for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.39,0:07:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, someone will still get\Nerased if you don't answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.23,0:07:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even a wild guess will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.36,0:07:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tsk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.94,0:07:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The one you're impersonating...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...is Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.28,0:07:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not confident, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She was that bold, so just maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.58,0:08:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.79,0:08:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's gone! Were you correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shin, Kotori. Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.88,0:08:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reine? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just now, again by Natsumi's Angel,\Nsome people have disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.14,0:08:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.10,0:08:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Both Ai Yamabuki and Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.27,0:08:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's two days later and I still\Nhaven't guessed Natsumi correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ms. Okamine, Mai Hazakura...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mii Fujibakama, and Tonomachi\Nhave all been erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shin, you're almost to the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, did you wait long?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.92,0:08:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been observing her, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.00,0:08:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's been waiting here for over an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:57.85,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Dog & Cat"   "Terror"   \N"Galaxy"   "Love Story"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.80,0:08:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, what are we watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know. Haven't really decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:09:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, you invited me\Nnot to see a specific movie...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.77,0:09:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But because you wanted to go out with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.56,0:09:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Uh, well... I guess it's like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.49,0:09:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How far are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.99,0:09:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As far as it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.87,0:09:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.63,0:09:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wha--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to touch me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not wearing anything today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? You...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.31,0:09:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That wore me out, heart and body...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.27,0:09:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.86,0:09:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka! Why are you out this late?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.65,0:09:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what I want to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.74,0:10:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These past few days,\Nyou've seemed so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.95,0:10:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You don't have to apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're doing something\Nthat you have to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.67,0:10:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though, it's sad not being able to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.63,0:10:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If there's anything I can do to help, say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka... Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like a new person now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.43,0:10:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.81,0:10:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.56,0:10:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.56,0:10:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I want to get to Tengu\NStreet, is it this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.61,0:10:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go left at the second light\Nand you'll run into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.57,0:10:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. My GPS is broke, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.41,0:10:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I appreciate it, young couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think I sounded awkward back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I doubt they suspect anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.05,0:10:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that's Shido Itsuka...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:11:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and Princess, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.05,0:11:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seems like they're doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.01,0:11:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, good night, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.35,0:11:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good night, Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.85,0:11:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.69,0:11:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi... "That I love you," was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home, Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.82,0:11:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido! Where have you been?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard from Reine just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Eh?\N--That Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That Tohka vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.50,0:11:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka! Tohka! Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.34,0:11:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You seem a bit panicked today, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one who didn't come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.07,0:11:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I took that as no guess for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Which means I erased\Nanother person like usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You little...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.45,0:12:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Still, I'm thinking I wanna end this soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.91,0:12:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,End this? Meaning what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.41,0:12:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you guess correctly tonight, I'll return\Nall the people that disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, if you don't guess right, it's my win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.30,0:12:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be taking the place of all your\Nmissing friends from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.26,0:12:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In other words...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those 12 precious people will never\Ncome back to this world again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This time is special, so I'll\Ncome back at 11:30 tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.56,0:12:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.57,0:12:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will... I'll save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.99,0:12:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.21,0:12:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That Shido... He makes such a good\Nface when someone disappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's not nearly enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Show me what true despair looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.68,0:13:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the fate of those who see my secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see you drown in sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody will be able to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.27,0:13:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because nobody looks for me anyways...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while, Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.78,0:13:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thirty years or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see you're doing well, Ike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That makes everyone then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.38,0:13:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.67,0:13:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know it's sudden, but you all\Nknow the situation now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got you all involved \Nin this... and I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.93,0:13:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well don't fret about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:14:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you should have told the truth\Nwhen Yuzuru disappeared at the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.19,0:14:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a bit sad to hear our date was\Nall part of the search though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.86,0:14:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have lots of things to ask, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For now, I'll keep quiet and cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.82,0:14:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go through it once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.08,0:14:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi is impersonating one\Nof these 12 people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.87,0:14:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So far, Shido has guessed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Yoshino, Ms. Okamine, and Mai Hazakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can exclude these three.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And Natsumi has erased...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Yuzuru, Ai Yamabuki, Hiroto Tonomachi,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.81,0:14:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mii Fujibakama, and Tohka.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's possible she was one of those five.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.64,0:14:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's also the five of us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That makes us strong suspects,\Nbut to impersonate one of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,it would be hard for her to pull off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.86,0:14:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Our traits are too complex\Nto be imitated by anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.37,0:14:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yeah... Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.87,0:15:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Witch... This Spirit you're\Nall calling Natsumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.62,0:15:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why would she take such a risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The way she's does it,\Nevery time a person disappears,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,it raises the chance of guessing right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By the end, it'll be hard to guess wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Witch is confident she won't be guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.43,0:15:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Meaning, no matter what\Nwe come at her with,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.18,0:15:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,we will never guess correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.89,0:15:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For example...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.57,0:15:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She concealed herself as\Na photo, or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the sort of creative\Nthinking I think we'll need.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.53,0:15:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think maybe she's\Nimpersonating nobody at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't imagine that's the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.54,0:15:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.25,0:15:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi is probably stretching the\Nrules to say safe the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.26,0:15:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Could she be one of these five?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.60,0:16:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.10,0:16:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's the one--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.02,0:16:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no! She's so gorgeous, it's no fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.11,0:16:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.36,0:16:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, it's the night we've been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, can you actually guess\Nwho I'm impersonating tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.91,0:16:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get it all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.49,0:16:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi, for your sake, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.25,0:16:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph. Give it your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, I'll give you three guesses tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Each time you're wrong, one of your\Nfriends right here will disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.05,0:16:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's hear your first guess now. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.89,0:16:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how you look at it,\Nyou can't be one of the four people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.89,0:16:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You wouldn't bet everything on\Na game with a 75% chance to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're among the five people you erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:16:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You made yourself safe\Nas quick as possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:17:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...as someone we'd least expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The first one who went, Yuzuru.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.79,0:17:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hold on! Yuzuru was the real deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She did nothing I thought strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.34,0:17:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know... I'm not certain either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.89,0:17:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.26,0:17:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If Natsumi was actually Yuzuru,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.39,0:17:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--everything makes--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--That's too bad.\N--everything makes--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.10,0:17:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sh-She disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're kidding! It wasn't Yuzuru?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.11,0:17:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what I've been saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.11,0:17:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come now, my great detectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.45,0:17:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who will you name next?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you run out of time,\NI'll suck someone else up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.29,0:17:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Elliot is on the move, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.75,0:17:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's fill the hole in\Nyour support personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.88,0:17:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The thing is, finding someone worthy\Nof an Adeptus number isn't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But isn't there one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.89,0:18:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The one who gave you that scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.60,0:18:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now there's an outstanding Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.73,0:18:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.81,0:18:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down, Shido. I think\Nyou're on the right track.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.23,0:18:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is Natsumi?! Who?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.65,0:18:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, jeez! I don't have any clue!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.99,0:18:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We just don't have enough hints!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.07,0:18:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, time's almost up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.53,0:18:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can get rid of someone without\Nyou guessing, but do you want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.33,0:18:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In that case, it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, too bad. That's wrong, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaguya!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.80,0:18:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, now. This is your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's going to be your final guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't take it, Darling! I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To think I finally met Darling,\Nand now I'll disappear?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.60,0:18:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep it together, Miku! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.15,0:18:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey. Thirty seconds left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.61,0:18:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tsk!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.69,0:18:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, Darling...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:18:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.49,0:19:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't disappear without leaving\Na piece of me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.03,0:19:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because if I wear this,\Nit'll disappear together with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wear this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Together?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.67,0:19:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? What are you doing, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.01,0:19:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got it, Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.06,0:19:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That is, the reason you're so calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.48,0:19:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.77,0:19:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're impersonating someone\Nin one of the 12 pictures,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.61,0:19:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but not one of the 12 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Yoshinon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way. Why would Yoshinon...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that I remember, it was strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.83,0:19:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshinon is Yoshino's puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.25,0:19:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It shouldn't be able to see\Nsomething Yoshino can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What Miku said gave me the hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.97,0:20:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When Yoshino disappeared,\NYoshinon disappeared with her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.22,0:20:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well? How's that, Natsumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.93,0:20:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were you impersonating Yoshinon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.08,0:20:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.50,0:20:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.96,0:20:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido! This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.17,0:20:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.88,0:20:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whew, I feel like I was\Ntaking the longest nap...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Doubt. What am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.76,0:20:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Yuzuru! Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.89,0:20:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Thank goodness, you're all okay!\N--Yuzuru! Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.77,0:20:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you do all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.77,0:20:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Time for you to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.95,0:21:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you... Natsumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.53,0:21:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.74,0:21:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.87,0:21:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.99,0:21:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haniel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.04,0:21:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is her form after\Ntransforming with Spirit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.05,0:21:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You saw...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.09,0:21:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You saw! You saw! You saw! You saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.43,0:21:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've seen my secret, not once, but twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.51,0:21:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unforgivable! It's unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.22,0:21:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,None of you are getting away with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.81,0:21:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this in place of farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.44,0:21:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just wait... I will have my revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Natsumi! We can talk...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.87,0:21:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.91,0:21:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.37,0:21:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.37,0:21:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They say there is only one truth, however...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.50,0:22:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The future ahead can be many, not one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.09,0:22:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Which one do you choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.13,0:22:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.63,0:22:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.63,0:22:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:41.40,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Four:\N'Transformation'"
